# --- Raw API responses -------------------------------------------------------
# The bulky per-page JSON is excluded: ~19 MB, and fully regenerable with
#   python src/fetch_estat.py data --statsdataid <id> --reference-year <year> ...
# Download MANIFESTS are deliberately kept. They carry the provenance that makes
# the pipeline auditable: statsDataId, survey-year label, reference year,
# download timestamp, and the replaceSpChar setting.
raw_data/**/*_p[0-9][0-9].json
!raw_data/**/manifest_*.json

# Raw discovery dumps (~1.5 MB). The derived, readable index CSVs are committed
# instead; regenerate with `python src/fetch_estat.py discover`.
metadata/estat_statslist_raw*.json

# --- Source materials, not project output ------------------------------------
# Working documents and third-party copyrighted material.
*.docx
*.pdf

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
.env

# --- OS ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Local tooling -----------------------------------------------------------
# Editor/assistant permission settings. Not project content, and they embed
# absolute paths from the local machine.
.claude/
